.( Loading Matrix Multiplication benchmark...) cr\ A classical benchmark of an O(n**3) algorithm; Matrix Multiplication\\ Part of the programs gathered by John Hennessy for the MIPS\ RISC project at Stanford. Translated to forth by Matin Freamen,\ Johns Hopkins University/Applied Physics Laboratory.4 constant cell: cells ( n -- m)  cell * ;: align ( -- ) here cell 1- and allot ;variable seed: initiate-seed ( -- )  74755 seed ! ;: random  ( -- n )  seed @ 1309 * 13849 + 65535 and dup seed ! ;40 constant rowsizerowsize rowsize * cells constant matsizealign create ima   rowsize 1+ dup * cells allotalign create imb   rowsize 1+ dup * cells allotalign create imr   rowsize 1+ dup * cells allot: initiate-matrix ( m[rowsize+1][rowsize+1] -- )  dup matsize + swap do    random dup 120 / 120 * - 60 - i !  cell +loop ;: innerproduct ( a[r][*] b[*][c] -- result)  0 rowsize 0 do    >r over @ over @ * r> + >r    cell + swap rowsize cells + swap    r>  loop  swap drop swap drop ;: matrix-mult  ( -- )  initiate-seed  ima initiate-matrix  imb initiate-matrix   imr ima matsize + ima do    imb rowsize cells + imb do      j i innerproduct over ! cell +     cell +loop  rowsize cells +loop drop ;forth only